{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-204808-r4613375","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Tuna and Herb Salad","sourcePageId":204808,"sourceRevision":"4613375","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2026-01-24T04:02:32Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Tuna%20and%20Herb%20Salad&oldid=4613375","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T16:18:27.026Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for salad","Category:Recipes using Dijon mustard","Category:Recipes using basil","Category:Recipes using feta","Category:Recipes using hot sauce","Category:Recipes using lemon juice","Category:Recipes using marjoram","Category:Recipes using olive oil","Category:Recipes using oregano","Category:Recipes using parsley","Category:Recipes using pepper","Category:Recipes using rosemary","Category:Recipes using tuna","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Very Easy recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"5409add8c9a79e93656f6fc8f2d1535b953e8c59a33fa3c77f9fe92c9fc6e537","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Salad recipes\n| Difficulty = 1\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} [[Category:Recipes using tuna]] [[Category:Recipes for salad]]\n[[Category:Recipes using basil]]\n\nYes, canned tuna is the poster child for gross canned food, but this salad will change that.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* 1 can (12 [[Cookbook:Ounce|oz]]) water-pack albacore [[Cookbook:Tuna|tuna]], drained\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]] to taste\n* Freshly-ground [[Cookbook:Pepper|black pepper]] to taste\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Dijon Mustard|Dijon mustard]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] freshly-squeezed [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n* 2 tsp grated [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]] [[Cookbook:Zest|zest]]\n* 6 tbsp extra-virgin [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] fresh [[Cookbook:Basil|basil]]\n* 2 tbsp fresh [[Cookbook:Rosemary|rosemary]], finely chopped\n* ¼ cup fresh [[Cookbook:Oregano|oregano]]\n* ¼ cup flat-leaf [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]]\n* ¼ cup fresh [[Cookbook:Marjoram|marjoram]]\n* [[Cookbook:Hot Sauce|Hot sauce]], to taste\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Worcestershire Sauce|Worcestershire sauce]]\n* ½ cup crumbled [[Cookbook:Feta Cheese|feta cheese]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine juice, zest, mustard, hot sauce, and Worcestershire sauce. Slowly stream in olive oil while whisking continuously until oil has been integrated. \n#Season to taste with salt and freshly ground black pepper.\n#Combine remaining ingredients except for cheese. Add dressing and [[Cookbook:Mixing#Tossing|toss]] to coat. Sprinkle with feta before serving.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for salad]]\n[[Category:Recipes using feta]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using Dijon mustard]]\n[[Category:Recipes using parsley]]\n[[Category:Recipes using oregano]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rosemary]]\n[[Category:Recipes using olive oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using marjoram]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tuna]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hot sauce]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Tuna and Herb Salad","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 can (12 oz) water-p